amai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407990/4c4a8f0455a7ee4ddc3f86b17f9cc3cc93e3fdfa/ss_4c4a8f0455a7ee4ddc3f86b17f9cc3cc93e3fdfa.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772592886","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407990/4c4a8f0455a7ee4ddc3f86b17f9cc3cc93e3fdfa/ss_4c4a8f0455a7ee4ddc3f86b17f9cc3cc93e3fdfa.600x338.jpg?t=1772592886"}],"short_description":"A turn-based RPG where every battle is a puzzle, and every choice carries weight. Guide Paul Kimbel, a troubled author trapped between life and death, through a haunting world built from his own imagination. No grinding\u2014just pure strategy, exploration, and high-stakes combat.","steam_appid":3407990,"support_info":{"email":"support@indie.io","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}